---
// Homepage intro: tells first-time visitors what the site offers and where to start.
---

<section class="site-intro" aria-labelledby="site-intro-title">
  <h1 id="site-intro-title" class="site-intro-title">
    Practical data engineering, from production pipelines to your next interview
  </h1>
  <p class="site-intro-text">
    Reliable Data Engineering is written by a senior data engineer for people who build data platforms. Read
    in-depth articles on Databricks, Spark, dbt, SQL migration and AI for data, then prepare for senior interviews
    with a free, hands-on study platform.
  </p>

  <div class="site-intro-grid">
    <a href="#latest-articles" class="site-intro-card">
      <span class="site-intro-kicker">Blog</span>
      <span class="site-intro-card-title">Articles and deep dives</span>
      <span class="site-intro-card-text">
        Lakehouse architecture, Spark and Delta tuning, dbt at scale, legacy migrations and AI agents, written from
        real projects.
      </span>
      <span class="site-intro-cta">Read the latest articles</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/interview-prep/" class="site-intro-card">
      <span class="site-intro-kicker">Interview Prep</span>
      <span class="site-intro-card-title">Free senior DE interview platform</span>
      <span class="site-intro-card-text">
        System design with diagrams, 41 SQL and 27 Python problems that run in your browser, data modeling cases and
        flashcards. No account needed.
      </span>
      <span class="site-intro-cta">Start preparing</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/resources" class="site-intro-card">
      <span class="site-intro-kicker">Resources</span>
      <span class="site-intro-card-title">Books and tools worth your time</span>
      <span class="site-intro-card-text">
        The books, tools and databases I use and recommend, with honest notes on where each one falls short.
      </span>
      <span class="site-intro-cta">Browse resources</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .site-intro {
    padding: 2rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .site-intro-title {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-weight: 700;
    max-width: 48rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .site-intro-title {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
    }
  }
  .site-intro-text {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 48rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .site-intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .site-intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .site-intro-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .site-intro-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .site-intro-kicker {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .site-intro-card-title {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .site-intro-card-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .site-intro-cta {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
